   "ruling": "Ruling: representation; project retained. No one on the return made traditional IRA contributions (both persons' traditional contributions are $0.00; ira.any_trad false), and the IRA Deduction Worksheet is used to figure a deduction for traditional IRA contributions (i1040gi, Line 20, IRA Deduction: \"If you made contributions to a traditional IRA for 2025, you may be able to take an IRA deduction\"); the project shows line 7 as zero when the worksheet has nothing to limit (ira.line7a/7b take ira.zero), while each person's own line 7 ($8,000.00, age 50 or older) is carried in person.ira_line7. The model entered the applicable amount ($8,000) for a worksheet nobody completes. Lines 12a and 12b (the smallest of line 7, 10 and 11) and Schedule 1 line 20 are zero either way, and no printed amount a filer uses differs. Not evidence. [dropped]"
